@@ -0,0 +1,94 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later
+# /**************************************************************************
+#                                                                           *
+#    This file is part of FreeCAD.                                          *
+#                                                                           *
+#    FreeCAD is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify it     *
+#    under the terms of the GNU Lesser General Public License as            *
